---
system: sys-12-support-admin-operations
flow_id: mqtt-remote-command
surface: admin
spec_anchor: /software/systems/12-support-admin-operations#mqtt-remote-command-sequence
actors: [AdminConsole, AdminCommandService, AuditLog, MQTT, Device]
apis:
  - POST /admin/devices/:id/reboot
  - POST /admin/devices/:id/trigger-ota
  - POST /admin/devices/:id/factory-reset
externals: [MQTT]
queues: []
failure_paths:
  - role_insufficient
  - device_not_found
  - device_offline
  - mqtt_publish_failure
  - command_ack_timeout
idempotency: per-command UUID `command_id` — device dedupes on command_id with 1h cache; retained flag on factory-reset/transfer
retry: QoS 1 + retained flag for destructive commands; admin-side no auto-retry
timeout: 5 min device ACK before declaring delivery_failure
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED. Normalized from _seed.1; destructive commands gated by super_admin role.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminConsole
    participant AdminCommandService
    participant AuditLog
    participant MQTT
    participant Device

    AdminConsole->>AdminCommandService: POST /admin/devices/:id/{reboot|trigger-ota|factory-reset} {reason}

    alt role_insufficient
        Note over AdminCommandService: support_agent for reboot/trigger-ota — super_admin for factory-reset
        AdminCommandService-->>AdminConsole: 403 INSUFFICIENT_ROLE
    else device_not_found
        AdminCommandService-->>AdminConsole: 404 device_not_found
    else accepted
        AdminCommandService->>AuditLog: append {action: remote_command, target: device:id, reason}
        AdminCommandService->>MQTT: publish tjbot/{id}/commands/{verb} {command, command_id, issued_by, issued_at} (QoS 1, retained for factory-reset/transfer)
        alt mqtt_publish_failure
            MQTT-->>AdminCommandService: error
            AdminCommandService-->>AdminConsole: 502 mqtt_publish_failure
        else published
            MQTT-->>AdminCommandService: ack (broker)
            AdminCommandService-->>AdminConsole: 202 {command_id, status: dispatched}
        end

        alt device_offline
            MQTT--xDevice: undelivered (retained held until reconnect)
            Note over AdminConsole,Device: queued in broker — agent polls /admin/devices/:id for status
        else online
            MQTT->>Device: deliver command
            Device->>Device: dedupe on command_id (1h cache) + execute
            Device->>MQTT: publish tjbot/{id}/results/{verb} {command_id, result}
            MQTT->>AdminCommandService: forward result
            AdminCommandService->>AuditLog: append {action: command_result, command_id, result}
        end

        alt command_ack_timeout
            Note over AdminCommandService: 5 min elapsed — no result published
            AdminCommandService->>AuditLog: append {action: command_timeout, command_id}
        end
    end

    Note over AdminConsole,Device: destructive commands (factory-reset, transfer) use retained flag — every command writes 2 audit rows (dispatched + result/timeout)
